  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "建築設計(十)",
    "sub_ename": "ARCHITECTURAL DESIGN(10)",
    "describe_ch": "第二學期,學生繼續發展其表現技巧與設計策略以因應當今的多重現實.近年有關古蹟維護,社區建築以及永續建築已成為主流的設計趨勢.在教學上,任何建築創作都必須深深的涉入實質的設計導向以及環境的關懷.",
    "describe_eh": "The second semester, when confronting today's multiple realities, students are asked to develop representational techniques and design strategies on architecture design work. In recent years, an increasing trends of historical preservation, social community architecture and sustainable architecture are all related on design work.pedagogically. Any architecture creation must operate between the physicality and design orientation of architecture and environmental concern.",
    "pre_subname": "ARCH1001建築設計(一)、ARCH4001建築設計(七)、ARCH2001建築設計(三)、ARCH5001建築設計(九)、ARCH1002建築設計(二)、ARCH3001建築設計(五)、ARCH4002建築設計(八)、ARCH3002建築設計(六)、ARCH2002建築設計(四)",
    "pre_sub_id3": "ARCH1001",
    "pre_sub_ename": "ARCH1001 ARCHITECTURAL DESIGN(1)、ARCH4001 ARCHITECTURAL DESIGN(7)、ARCH2001 ARCHITECTURAL DESIGN(3)、ARCH5001 ARCHITECTURAL DESIGN(9)、ARCH1002 ARCHITECTURAL DESIGN(2)、ARCH3001 ARCHITECTURAL DESIGN(5)、ARCH4002 ARCHITECTURAL DESIGN(8)、ARCH3002 ARCHITECTURAL DESIGN(6)、ARCH2002 ARCHITECTURAL DESIGN(4)",
